      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm a high school debate coach and I need some help. My student is arguing *for* Universal Basic Income (UBI) in a tournament next week, but they're really struggling to anticipate the counter-arguments. Can you find the weakest points in the UBI argument and provide the most devastating rebuttals possible so they know what to look out for?",
