    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty solid summary of the pro side. But looking back at the rebuttals you gave me earlier, it feels like the opposition's points are much more \"grounded\" in reality, especially regarding the actual math and the risk of people just quitting their jobs. Don't you think the UBI arguments are a bit idealistic and ignore the practical economic consequences that would actually happen if we tried this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
